== Meseta

#poem[][

Yellow brown finer than sand\
Up to my knees\
Rest time now; release the laces!\
A poof of sacred trail\
Straight up to Saint Hunna\
Abbess, my soul!

Tell me:\
  Is this how to\
    Invite the Spirit?\
  From dust up?\
    Held uninvited by socks?

Grungy work\
  this sanctification

][0000000121201]